# The generated USDA artifacts (scripts/usda-bundle.mjs, ADR-0047 section 3).
# Their serialisation is one food per line so that a mirror refresh diffs as
# changed, added and removed foods; Prettier would re-wrap 4.7 MB of them into
# half a million lines and take the reviewable diff with it.
public/usda/

# Generated, and byte-compared against its generator by `pnpm check`
