# re-wrapping it here would make the staleness gate fail on every commit.
docs/food-search.html

# The drop census (scripts/usda-drop-census.mjs), one drop per line for the same
# reason public/usda/ is here: the unit of a reviewable diff is one food.
docs/research/usda-drop-census.json

# The collapse account (scripts/usda-collapse.mjs's `collapseAccount`, written by
# `pnpm usda:bundle`). Byte-compared against a rebuild from the shipped corpus by
# `pnpm check` (scripts/usda-account-check.mjs), so its layout is the generator's:
# a re-wrap here would fail the gate on the commit that made it, which is what
# happened to docs/food-search.html before its entry above.
docs/research/190-corpus-account.md
